<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 67.73 to 6833.10, a record. For the week, the Dow gained 129.31 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.19 to 409.31, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share finished up $0.33.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1464 to 984.</p>
<p>Volume was 532,436,160 compared with 532,313,930 on Thursday.</p>
